1
00:00:03,588 --> 00:00:04,758
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

2
00:00:05,047 --> 00:00:07,797
We're going to the Apple store
to make fun of the Genius Bar.

3
00:00:07,967 --> 00:00:09,467
You wanna come?

4
00:00:09,844 --> 00:00:13,184
(Sheldon:)Oh, I always enjoy that,
but I'm a little busy.

5
00:00:13,347 --> 00:00:14,427
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

6
00:00:14,599 --> 00:00:16,889
(Sheldon:)I'm simplifying the task of packing
for our trip.

7
00:00:17,059 --> 00:00:19,099
(Sheldon:)See, by attaching RFID tags
to my clothing...

8
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:23,230
(Sheldon:)...it will enable my laptop to read
and identify the items with this wand.

9
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:27,069
(Sheldon:)Then cross-reference them against
destination, anticipated activity spectrum...

10
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:30,116
(Sheldon:)...weather conditions,
duration of trip, etc.

11
00:00:33,576 --> 00:00:35,616
(Leonard:)Well, that does sound much simpler.

12
00:00:37,413 --> 00:00:38,703
How long is this gonna take?

13
00:00:38,873 --> 00:00:41,543
(Sheldon:)Assuming I can keep up this pace,
three hours 11 minutes.

14
00:00:41,709 --> 00:00:45,589
(Sheldon:)Plus however long it takes to conclude
this fairly pointless conversation.

15
00:00:46,464 --> 00:00:47,634
(Leonard:)Wow.

16
00:00:47,965 --> 00:00:51,215
(Leonard:)Teasing the guys at the Apple store
seems a little redundant now.

17
00:00:51,385 --> 00:00:54,675
- I don't follow.
- I wouldn't expect you to. I'll see you later.

18
00:00:56,265 --> 00:00:57,475
[SCANNER BEEPS]

19
00:00:58,017 --> 00:01:05,027
(Sheldon:)Socks, one pair, cotton, argyle, blue.

